OL,3,GNEWSAFury v Joshua fight could see
OL,4,Aearly-hours start time at Principality
OL,5,AStadium
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe expected timings for Tyson Fury and
OL,8,FAnthony Joshua's highly anticipated
OL,9,Fheavyweight boxing clash have been
OL,10,Frevealed.
OL,12,FThe bout - one of the biggest in
OL,13,FBritish boxing history - is set to take
OL,14,Fplace at the Principality Stadium in
OL,15,FCardiff on 11 December.
OL,17,FAn application to Cardiff Council
OL,18,Frevealed the ring walk is planned to
OL,19,Fstart at around 01:00 GMT after a short
OL,20,Flive music performance, and the stadium
OL,21,Fwill remain open until 03:30.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
