OL,3,GNEWSAFury v Joshua fight could see
OL,4,Aearly-hours start time at Principality
OL,5,AStadium
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite the choice of venue being
OL,8,Fconfirmed in September, required
OL,9,Fchanges to its premises licence to
OL,10,Fallow the early-hours fight to go ahead
OL,11,Fhave yet to be secured.
